=== README.md ===
# Sistema de Gestão de Tarefas de Equipe

Uma aplicação web completa (um único arquivo) para gerenciar tarefas em equipe.
- **Membros** entram com sua conta e veem suas tarefas, mudam o status e criam tarefas para si.
- **Gerente** cria, distribui, edita e remove tarefas e vê tudo de todos.
- **Dados salvos no site (navegador)**: tudo fica salvo no próprio navegador. Nada é perdido se você fechar e abrir de novo.
- **Funciona em qualquer dispositivo**: funciona em qualquer computador ou celular.

## O que precisa para funcionar

1. Um navegador (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge, etc.) com internet.
2. Um espaço para "hospedar" o site (colocar o arquivo na internet).

## Como usar

1. **Primeiro acesso (crie o gerente):**
   - Abra o site. A primeira conta que você cadastrar será o **gerente** (e o dono do sistema).
   - Depois, volte para a tela de login e faça login com essa conta.

2. **Criar a equipe:**
   - No menu, clique em **Equipe** e adicione cada membro com nome, e-mail e senha.
   - O e-mail é o que cada pessoa usa para entrar.

3. **Cada membro entra:**
   - Cada pessoa usa a página de login e entra com seu e-mail e senha.
   - Cada um vê apenas suas tarefas.

4. **Distribuir tarefas:**
   - O gerente (ou membro) cria tarefas em **Nova Tarefa** e escolhe para quem.
   - O membro vê a tarefa e muda o status (Aberta, Em andamento, Concluída, Bloqueada).

## Como instalar e executar

### Opção 1 — Rodar no seu computador (teste rápido)

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

Depois acesse no navegador: `http://localhost:8000`

### Opção 2 — Publicar na internet (funcionar de verdade)

Coloque o arquivo `index.html` em um serviço de hospedagem gratuita. Exemplos:
- **GitHub Pages** (recomendado)
- **Netlify**
- **Vercel**

Passo a passo (GitHub Pages):
1. Crie uma conta gratuita em https://github.com
2. Crie um novo repositório (ex.: `minha-tarefas`)
3. Envie o arquivo `index.html` para o repositório
4. Em "Settings" → "Pages", marque "Deploy from a branch" (main)
5. Pronto: o site ficará em algo como `https://SEU-USER.github.io/minha-tarefas`

## ⚠️ Importante sobre os dados

Os dados são salvos **no navegador** (localStorage). Por isso:
- **Funciona em qualquer dispositivo**: um membro entra com sua conta e vê suas tarefas.
- **Não se perde ao fechar**: o navegador guarda os dados.
- **Limite**: o navegador de cada pessoa guarda seus próprios dados. Para que o que o gerente vê apareça **exatamente** para os membros (em tempo real, em qualquer dispositivo), é necessário um **backend/servidor** (ex.: Firebase, Supabase, etc.).

A aplicação atual é **auto-suficiente** e funciona em qualquer navegador. Se você quiser sincronização em tempo real entre dispositivos, é só pedir — eu adiciono um backend (ex.: Firebase) para que tudo fique salvo em um servidor na nuvem.

## Comandos de uso

```bash
# Rodar localmente
python3 -m http.server 8000

# Ou abrir direto no navegador
# (duplo clique no arquivo index.html)
```

## Estrutura

```
index.html
```

Um único arquivo HTML com CSS e JavaScript embutidos.

=== index.html ===
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tarefas de Equipe</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0f172a; --panel:#111827; --panel2:#1f2937; --line:#232c3a;
    --text:#e5e7eb; --muted:#94a3b8; --accent:#4f46e5; --accent2:#6366f1;
    --ok:#10b981; --warn:#f59e0b; --danger:#ef4444; --info:#38bdf8;
    --radius:14px; --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;height:100%}
  body{
    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); line-height:1.5;
  }
  a{color:var(--accent2)}
  button{font-family:inherit}
  .hidden{display:none !important}

  /* ---------- Login ---------- */
  .auth-wrap{
    min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 20% -10%, rgba(79,70,229,.35), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 110% 110%, rgba(56,189,248,.25), transparent 60%),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .auth-card{
    width:100%; max-width:420px; background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow); padding:28px;
  }
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:18px}
  .brand .logo{
    width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2)); font-size:22px;
  }
  .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0}
  .brand p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
  .tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .tabs button{
    flex:1;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel2);
    color:var(--muted);border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;
  }
  .tabs button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
  .field{margin-bottom:14px}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
  input,select,textarea{
    width:100%;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;
  }
  textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:90px}
  input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent2)}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    padding:11px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;
    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:transform .05s ease, filter .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
  .btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border-color:var(--line);color:var(--text)}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--panel2)}
  .btn-danger{background:transparent;border-color:var(--danger);color:var(--danger)}
  .btn-danger:hover{background:var(--danger);color:#fff}
  .btn-sm{padding:6px 10px;font-size:13px;border-radius:8px}
  .btn-block{width:100%}
  .hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;text-align:center}
  .hint b{color:var(--text)}

  /* ---------- App shell ---------- */
  .app{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100vh}
  .topbar{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 18px;
    background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .topbar .logo{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));font-size:18px}
  .topbar .title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700}
  .topbar .spacer{flex:1}
  .user-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--panel2);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px}
  .user-chip .avatar{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
  .role-badge{font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
  .role-badge.member{background:var(--info)}

  .nav{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:10px 18px;background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .nav button{
    padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);
    border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;
  }
  .nav button.active{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text);border-color:var(--line)}
  .nav button:hover{color:var(--text)}

  .content{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:20px}
  .content-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}

  .page-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
  .page-head h2{margin:0;font-size:20px}
  .page-head .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

  /* ---------- Cards / grid ---------- */
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}
  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px}
  .card h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px}
  .card .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

  .task-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
  .task-card .top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}
  .task-card .title{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
  .task-card .desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  .task-card .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .task-card .actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2px}
  .task-card .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px}
  .task-card .who .avatar{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent2);
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}

  .status-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .status-pill .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
  .st-aberta .dot{background:var(--info)}
  .st-aberta{color:var(--info)}
  .st-em_andamento .dot{background:var(--warn)}
  .st-em_andamento{color:var(--warn)}
  .st-concluida .dot{background:var(--ok)}
  .st-concluida{color:var(--ok)}
  .st-bloqueada .dot{background:var(--danger)}
  .st-bloqueada{color:var(--danger)}

  .prio{font-size:12px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
  .prio-alta{color:var(--danger);border-color:var(--danger)}
  .prio-media{color:var(--warn);border-color:var(--warn)}
  .prio-baixa{color:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok)}

  .empty{text-align:center;padding:40px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--panel);
    border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)}

  /* ---------- Modal ---------- */
  .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);display:flex;
    align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;z-index:50}
  .modal{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);width:100%;max-width:520px;max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;padding:22px}
  .modal h2{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:18px}
  .modal .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
  .modal .row > *{flex:1}
  .modal .foot{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
  .form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
  .form-grid .full{grid-column:1/-1}

  /* ---------- Toast ---------- */
  .toast-host{position:fixed;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:100;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:center}
  .toast{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);
    padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    animation:pop .2s ease}
  .toast.error{border-color:var(--danger);color:var(--danger)}
  .toast.ok{border-color:var(--ok);color:var(--ok)}
  @keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}

  /* ---------- Stats ---------- */
  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .stat{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px}
  .stat .num{font-size:26px;font-weight:800}
  .stat .lbl{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  .stat.ok .num{color:var(--ok)} .stat.warn .num{color:var(--warn)}
  .stat.info .num{color:var(--info)} .stat.danger .num{color:var(--danger)}

  /* ---------- Member table ---------- */
  .member-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel2);margin-bottom:10px}
  .member-row .avatar{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
  .member-row .info{flex:1}
  .member-row .info .name{font-weight:600}
  .member-row .info .email{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  .member-row .count{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}

  /* ---------- Table ---------- */
  .table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel)}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
  th,td{padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  th{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;position:sticky;top:0}
  tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}

  /* ---------- Filter bar ---------- */
  .filter-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px}
  .filter-bar select{width:auto;min-width:140px}
  .filter-bar input{width:auto;min-width:180px}

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .content{padding:14px}
    .topbar{padding:10px 14px}
    .nav{padding:8px 12px;overflow-x:auto}
    .nav button{white-space:nowrap}
    .user-chip .name{display:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ LOGIN ============ -->
<div id="authView" class="auth-wrap">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">📋</div>
      <div>
        <h1>Tarefas de Equipe</div>
        <p>Gestão de tarefas para sua equipe</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs" id="authTabs">
      <button id="tabLogin" class="active">Entrar</button>
      <button id="tabRegister">Criar conta</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Login -->
    <form id="loginForm" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="loginEmail">E-mail</label>
        <input id="loginEmail" type="email" placeholder="voce@empresa.com" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="loginPass">Senha</label>
        <input id="loginPass" type="password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Entrar</button>
      <p class="hint" id="firstHint">A primeira conta criada será o <b>gerente</b>.</p>
    </form>

    <!-- Register -->
    <form id="registerForm" class="hidden" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="regName">Nome</label>
        <input id="regName" type="text" placeholder="Seu nome" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="regEmail">E-mail</label>
        <input id="regEmail" type="email" placeholder="voce@empresa.com" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="regPass">Senha</label>
        <input id="regPass" type="password" placeholder="Crie uma senha" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="regPass2">Confirmar senha</label>
        <input id="regPass2" type="password" placeholder="Repita a senha" required>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Criar conta</button>
      <p class="hint">A primeira conta será o <b>gerente</b>. Depois, crie os membros em <b>Equipe</b>.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ APP ============ -->
<div id="appView" class="app hidden">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="logo">📋</div>
    <div class="title">Tarefas de Equipe</div>
    <div class="spacer"></div>
    <div class="user-chip">
      <div class="avatar" id="userAvatar">?</div>
      <span class="name" id="userName">usuário</span>
      <span class="role-badge" id="userRole">Gerente</span>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="logoutBtn">Sair</button>
  </div>

  <nav class="nav" id="nav">
    <button data-view="me" class="active">Minhas tarefas</button>
    <button data-view="new">Nova tarefa</button>
    <button data-view="all" data-roles="gerente">Todas as tarefas</button>
    <button data-view="team" data-roles="gerente">Equipe</button>
  </nav>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="content-inner" id="viewRoot"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Modal -->
<div id="modal" class="modal-backdrop hidden"></div>
<div class="toast-host" id="toastHost"></div>

<script>
(function(){
  "use strict";

  /* ==================== ARMazenamento (localStorage) ==================== */
  const DB_KEY = "task_team_db_v1";
  const SESSION_KEY = "task_team_session_v1";

  function loadDB(){
    try{
      const raw = localStorage.getItem(DB_KEY);
      if(raw) return JSON.parse(raw);
    }catch(e){}
    return { users:[], tasks:[], nextId:1 };
  }
  function saveDB(db){
    localStorage.setItem(DB_KEY, JSON.stringify(db));
  }
  let db = loadDB();

  function persist(){
    saveDB(db);
    // Sincroniza entre abas do MESMO dispositivo
    window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("db-sync"));
  }

  /* ==================== Hash de senha (sim, simples) ==================== */
  function hashPass(str){
    // Hash simples por segurança (não é criptografia forte, mas evita texto puro)
    let h = 0;
    for(let i=0;i<str.length;i++){
      h = (h*31 + str.charCodeAt(i)) | 0;
    }
    return "h" + (h>>>0).toString(16);
  }

  /* ==================== Utilidades ==================== */
  function uid(){ return Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,10) + Date.now().toString(36); }
  function initials(name){
    return (name||"?").trim().split(/\s+/).slice(0,2).map(w=>w[0]).join("").toUpperCase();
  }
  function esc(s){
    return String(s==null?"":s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, c=>({
      "&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;"
    }[c]));
  }
  function fmtDate(iso){
    if(!iso) return "";
    const d = new Date(iso);
    return d.toLocaleDateString("pt-BR", {day:"2-digit",month:"2-digit",year:"numeric"}) +
           " " + d.toLocaleTimeString("pt-BR", {hour:"2-digit",minute:"2-digit"});
  }
  function fmtDateShort(iso){
    if(!iso) return "";
    const d = new Date(iso);
    return d.toLocaleDateString("pt-BR", {day:"2-digit",month:"2-digit",year:"numeric"});
  }

  const STATUS = {
    aberta:{label:"Aberta", cls:"st-aberta"},
    em_andamento:{label:"Em andamento", cls:"st-em_andamento"},
    concluida:{label:"Concluída", cls:"st-concluida"},
    bloqueada:{label:"Bloqueada", cls:"st-bloqueada"}
  };
  const PRIO = {
    baixa:{label:"Baixa", cls:"prio-baixa"},
    media:{label:"Média", cls:"prio-media"},
    alta:{label:"Alta", cls:"prio-alta"}
  };

  /* ==================== Sessão ==================== */
  function currentUser(){
    const id = localStorage.getItem(SESSION_KEY);
    if(!id) return null;
    return db.users.find(u=>u.id===id) || null;
  }
  function setSession(user){
    localStorage.setItem(SESSION_KEY, user.id);
  }
  function clearSession(){
    localStorage.removeItem(SESSION_KEY);
  }

  /* ==================== Toast ==================== */
  function toast(msg, type){
    const host = document.getElementById("toastHost");
    const el = document.createElement("div");
    el.className = "toast" + (type?" "+type:"");
    el.textContent = msg;
    host.appendChild(el);
    setTimeout(()=>{ el.style.opacity="0"; el.style.transition="opacity .3s"; setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),300); }, 2500);
  }

  /* ==================== Modal ==================== */
  const modal = document.getElementById("modal");
  function openModal(html){
    modal.innerHTML = html;
    modal.classList.remove("hidden");
    const close = modal.querySelector("[data-close]");
    if(close) close.addEventListener("click", closeModal);
    modal.addEventListener("click", e=>{ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });
  }
  function closeModal(){
    modal.classList.add("hidden");
    modal.innerHTML = "";
  }
  document.addEventListener("keydown", e=>{ if(e.key==="Escape") closeModal(); });

  /* ==================== Auth (login / registro) ==================== */
  const authView = document.getElementById("authView");
  const appView = document.getElementById("appView");
  const loginForm = document.getElementById("loginForm");
  const registerForm = document.getElementById("registerForm");
  const tabLogin = document.getElementById("tabLogin");
  const tabRegister = document.getElementById("tabRegister");

  function setAuthTab(which){
    tabLogin.classList.toggle("active", which==="login");
    tabRegister.classList.toggle("active", which==="register");
    loginForm.classList.toggle("hidden", which!=="login");
    registerForm.classList.toggle("hidden", which!=="register");
  }
  tabLogin.addEventListener("click", ()=>setAuthTab("login"));
  tabRegister.addEventListener("click", ()=>setAuthTab("register"));

  function updateFirstHint(){
    const hint = document.getElementById("firstHint");
    if(db.users.length===0){
      hint.innerHTML = "A primeira conta criada será o <b>gerente</b> (dono do sistema).";
    }else{
      hint.innerHTML = "Já existe gerente. Use <b>Criar conta</b> para criar novos membros, ou entre com o e-mail.";
    }
  }

  loginForm.addEventListener("submit", e=>{
    e.preventDefault();
    const email = document.getElementById("loginEmail").value.trim().toLowerCase();
    const pass = document.getElementById("loginPass").value;
    const user = db.users.find(u=>u.email===email);
    if(!user || user.passHash!==hashPass(pass)){
      toast("E-mail ou senha inválidos.", "error");
      return;
    }
    setSession(user);
    enterApp();
  });

  registerForm.addEventListener("submit", e=>{
    e.preventDefault();
    const name = document.getElementById("regName").value.trim();
    const email = document.getElementById("regEmail").value.trim().toLowerCase();
    const pass = document.getElementById("regPass").value;
    const pass2 = document.getElementById("regPass2").value;

    if(!name || !email) return;
    if(pass.length<4){ toast("Senha muito curta.", "error"); return; }
    if(pass!==pass2){ toast("As senhas não conferem.", "error"); return; }
    if(db.users.some(u=>u.email===email)){ toast("Já existe conta com esse e-mail.", "error"); return; }

    const role = db.users.length===0 ? "gerente" : "membro";
    const user = { id:uid(), name, email, passHash:hashPass(pass), role, createdAt:Date.now() };
    db.users.push(user);
    persist();
    setSession(user);
    enterApp();
    toast("Conta criada! Bem-vindo(a), " + name + ".", "ok");
  });

  document.getElementById("logoutBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>{
    clearSession();
    location.reload();
  });

  /* ==================== Renderização ==================== */
  const viewRoot = document.getElementById("viewRoot");
  const nav = document.getElementById("nav");

  function enterApp(){
    const user = currentUser();
    if(!user){ location.reload(); return; }
    authView.classList.add("hidden");
    appView.classList.remove("hidden");
    document.getElementById("userName").textContent = user.name;
    document.getElementById("userAvatar").textContent = initials(user.name);
    const roleBadge = document.getElementById("userRole");
    roleBadge.textContent = user.role==="gerente" ? "Gerente" : "Membro";
    roleBadge.classList.toggle("member", user.role!=="gerente");

    // Ajusta nav por papel
    nav.querySelectorAll("button").forEach(b=>{
      const roles = b.dataset.roles;
      if(roles && roles!=="gerente" && user.role!=="gerente"){ b.style.display="none"; }
      else b.style.display="";
    });

    // Define a view inicial
    if(user.role==="gerente") showView("me");
    else showView("me");

    bindNav();
  }

  function bindNav(){
    nav.querySelectorAll("button").forEach(b=>{
      b.onclick = ()=> showView(b.dataset.view);
    });
  }

  function showView(name){
    nav.querySelectorAll("button").forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle("active", b.dataset.view===name));
    const user = currentUser();
    if(!user) return;
    if(name==="me") renderMyTasks(user);
    else if(name==="all") renderAllTasks(user);
    else if(name==="new") renderNewTask(user);
    else if(name==="team") renderTeam(user);
  }

  function statusPill(key){
    const s = STATUS[key] || STATUS.aberta;
    return `<span class="status-pill ${s.cls}"><span class="dot"></span>${s.label}</span>`;
  }
  function prioTag(key){
    const p = PRIO[key] || PRIO.media;
    return `<span class="prio ${p.cls}">${p.label}</span>`;
  }
  function userAvatar(name){
    return `<span class="avatar">${initials(name)}</span>`;
  }

  function taskCardHTML(t, user, canEdit){
    const assignee = db.users.find(u=>u.id===t.assigneeId);
    const assigneeName = assignee ? assignee.name : "—";
    const isOwner = user.id===t.assigneeId;
    const isGerente = user.role==="gerente";

    // Status: gerente pode mudar qualquer; dono pode mudar a sua
    let canChangeStatus = isGerente || isOwner;
    let canEditTask = canEdit || isGerente;
    let canDelete = isGerente || (isOwner && t.assigneeId===user.id);

    let actions = "";
    if(canChangeStatus){
      actions += `<div class="status-select">
        <select data-status="${t.id}" style="width:auto;padding:6px 10px;font-size:13px">
          ${Object.keys(STATUS).map(k=>`<option value="${k}" ${k===t.status?"selected":""}>${STATUS[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
        </select>
      </div>`;
    }
    if(canEditTask){
      actions += `<button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-edit="${t.id}">Editar</button>`;
    }
    if(canDelete){
      actions += `<button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" data-del="${t.id}">Remover</button>`;
    }

    return `<div class="task-card" data-task="${t.id}">
      <div class="top">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <div class="title">${esc(t.title)}</div>
          <div class="meta">
            ${statusPill(t.status)} ${prioTag(t.priority)}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      ${t.description?`<div class="desc">${esc(t.description)}</div>`:""}
      <div class="meta">
        ${t.dueDate?`<span>📅 ${fmtDateShort(t.dueDate)}</span>`:""}
        ${t.createdBy?`<span>criado por ${esc(t.createdBy)}</span>`:""}
      </div>
      <div class="who">
        ${userAvatar(assigneeName)}
        <span>${esc(assigneeName)}${isOwner?` (você)`:""}</span>
      </div>
      ${actions?`<div class="actions">${actions}</div>`:""}
    </div>`;
  }

  function bindTaskCardActions(root){
    root.querySelectorAll("[data-status]").forEach(sel=>{
      sel.addEventListener("change", e=>{
        const t = db.tasks.find(x=>x.id===sel.dataset.status);
        if(t) t.status = sel.value;
        persist();
        toast("Status atualizado.", "ok");
        renderCurrentView();
      });
    });
    root.querySelectorAll("[data-edit]").forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener("click", ()=>{
        const t = db.tasks.find(x=>x.id===btn.dataset.edit);
        if(t) openTaskForm(t);
      });
    });
    root.querySelectorAll("[data-del]").forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener("click", ()=>{
        const t = db.tasks.find(x=>x.id===btn.dataset.del);
        if(!t) return;
        if(confirm(`Remover a tarefa "${t.title}"?`)){
          db.tasks = db.tasks.filter(x=>x.id!==t.id);
          persist();
          toast("Tarefa removida.", "ok");
          renderCurrentView();
        }
      });
    });
  }

  function renderCurrentView(){
    const active = nav.querySelector("button.active");
    if(active) showView(active.dataset.view);
  }

  /* ==================== View: Minhas tarefas ==================== */
  function renderMyTasks(user){
    const my = db.tasks.filter(t=>t.assigneeId===user.id)
      .sort((a,b)=>b.createdAt-a.createdAt);
    const stats = my.reduce((acc,t)=>{
      acc[t.status] = (acc[t.status]||0)+1;
      return acc;
    },{});

    viewRoot.innerHTML = `
      <div class="page-head">
        <div>
          <h2>Minhas tarefas</h2>
          <div class="sub">Você tem ${my.length} tarefa(s)</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="newTaskBtn">+ Nova tarefa</button>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat info"><div class="num">${stats.aberta||0}</div><div class="lbl">Abertas</div></div>
        <div class="stat warn"><div class="num">${stats.em_andamento||0}</div><div class="lbl">Em andamento</div></div>
        <div class="stat ok"><div class="num">${stats.concluida||0}</div><div class="lbl">Concluídas</div></div>
        <div class="stat danger"><div class="num">${stats.bloqueada||0}</div><div class="lbl">Bloqueadas</div></div>
      </div>
      ${my.length?`<div class="grid">${my.map(t=>taskCardHTML(t,user,false)).join("")}</div>`
        :`<div class="empty">Nenhuma tarefa ainda. Clique em <b>+ Nova tarefa</b> para criar.</div>`}
    `;
    document.getElementById("newTaskBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>showView("new"));
    bindTaskCardActions(viewRoot);
  }

  /* ==================== View: Todas as tarefas (gerente) ==================== */
  function renderAllTasks(user){
    const all = db.tasks.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.createdAt-a.createdAt);
    const stats = all.reduce((acc,t)=>{acc[t.status]=(acc[t.status]||0)+1;return acc;},{});

    viewRoot.innerHTML = `
      <div class="page-head">
        <div>
          <h2>Todas as tarefas</h2>
          <div class="sub">Total: ${all.length} | ${stats.concluida||0} concluídas</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="newTaskBtn">+ Nova tarefa</button>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat info"><div class="num">${stats.aberta||0}</div><div class="lbl">Abertas</div></div>
        <div class="stat warn"><div class="num">${stats.em_andamento||0}</div><div class="lbl">Em andamento</div></div>
        <div class="stat ok"><div class="num">${stats.concluida||0}</div><div class="lbl">Concluídas</div></div>
        <div class="stat danger"><div class="num">${stats.bloqueada||0}</div><div class="lbl">Bloqueadas</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="filter-bar">
        <select id="filterStatus">
          <option value="">Todos os status</option>
          ${Object.keys(STATUS).map(k=>`<option value="${k}">${STATUS[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
        </select>
        <select id="filterPrio">
          <option value="">Todas as prioridades</option>
          ${Object.keys(PRIO).map(k=>`<option value="${k}">${PRIO[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
        </select>
        <select id="filterAssignee">
          <option value="">Todos os membros</option>
          ${db.users.map(u=>`<option value="${u.id}">${esc(u.name)}</option>`).join("")}
        </select>
        <input id="filterSearch" type="text" placeholder="Buscar por título...">
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Tarefa</th>
              <th>Membro</th>
              <th>Status</th>
              <th>Prioridade</th>
              <th>Prazo</th>
              <th>Criado</th>
              <th></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="allTableBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    `;
    document.getElementById("newTaskBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>showView("new"));

    const body = document.getElementById("allTableBody");
    function renderTable(){
      let list = db.tasks.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.createdAt-a.createdAt);
      const fs = document.getElementById("filterStatus").value;
      const fp = document.getElementById("filterPrio").value;
      const fa = document.getElementById("filterAssignee").value;
      const q = document.getElementById("filterSearch").value.trim().toLowerCase();
      if(fs) list = list.filter(t=>t.status===fs);
      if(fp) list = list.filter(t=>t.priority===fp);
      if(fa) list = list.filter(t=>t.assigneeId===fa);
      if(q) list = list.filter(t=>t.title.toLowerCase().includes(q));
      body.innerHTML = list.length? list.map(t=>{
        const a = db.users.find(u=>u.id===t.assigneeId);
        return `<tr>
          <td>${esc(t.title)}</td>
          <td>${a?esc(a.name):"—"}</td>
          <td>${statusPill(t.status)}</td>
          <td>${prioTag(t.priority)}</td>
          <td>${t.dueDate?fmtDateShort(t.dueDate):"—"}</td>
          <td>${fmtDateShort(t.createdAt)}</td>
          <td>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-edit="${t.id}">Editar</button>
            <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" data-del="${t.id}">Remover</button>
          </td>
        </tr>`;
      }).join("") : `<tr><td colspan="7" style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted)">Nenhuma tarefa.</td></tr>`;
      bindTaskCardActions(body);
    }
    renderTable();
    ["filterStatus","filterPrio","filterAssignee","filterSearch"].forEach(id=>{
      document.getElementById(id).addEventListener("input", renderTable);
    });
  }

  /* ==================== View: Nova tarefa / Editar ==================== */
  function renderNewTask(user){
    const members = db.users.filter(u=>u.role==="membro" || u.id===user.id);
    viewRoot.innerHTML = `
      <div class="page-head">
        <div>
          <h2>Nova tarefa</h2>
          <div class="sub">Crie e distribua uma tarefa para um membro da equipe.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="max-width:560px">
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field full">
            <label>Título *</label>
            <input id="tTitle" type="text" placeholder="O que precisa ser feito?" maxlength="120">
          </div>
          <div class="field full">
            <label>Descrição</label>
            <textarea id="tDesc" placeholder="Detalhes, contexto, instruções..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Para quem *</label>
            <select id="tAssignee">
              ${members.map(u=>`<option value="${u.id}">${esc(u.name)}${u.id===user.id?" (você)":""}</option>`).join("")}
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Prioridade</label>
            <select id="tPriority">
              ${Object.keys(PRIO).map(k=>`<option value="${k}">${PRIO[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Status</label>
            <select id="tStatus">
              ${Object.keys(STATUS).map(k=>`<option value="${k}">${STATUS[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Prazo</label>
            <input id="tDue" type="date">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="foot">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="cancelBtn">Cancelar</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveBtn">Criar tarefa</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
    document.getElementById("cancelBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>showView("me"));
    document.getElementById("saveBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>{
      const title = document.getElementById("tTitle").value.trim();
      if(!title){ toast("Dê um título para a tarefa.", "error"); return; }
      const task = {
        id:uid(),
        title,
        description:document.getElementById("tDesc").value.trim(),
        assigneeId:document.getElementById("tAssignee").value,
        priority:document.getElementById("tPriority").value,
        status:document.getElementById("tStatus").value,
        dueDate:document.getElementById("tDue").value,
        createdBy:currentUser().name,
        createdAt:Date.now()
      };
      db.tasks.push(task);
      persist();
      toast("Tarefa criada!", "ok");
      showView("me");
    });
  }

  function openTaskForm(t){
    const user = currentUser();
    const members = db.users.filter(u=>u.role==="membro" || u.id===user.id);
    const showAssignee = user.role==="gerente";
    openModal(`
      <div class="modal">
        <h2>Editar tarefa</h2>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field full">
            <label>Título *</label>
            <input id="tTitle" type="text" value="${esc(t.title)}" maxlength="120">
          </div>
          <div class="field full">
            <label>Descrição</label>
            <textarea id="tDesc">${esc(t.description||"")}</textarea>
          </div>
          ${showAssignee?`<div class="field">
            <label>Para quem</label>
            <select id="tAssignee">
              ${members.map(u=>`<option value="${u.id}" ${u.id===t.assigneeId?"selected":""}>${esc(u.name)}</option>`).join("")}
            </select>
          </div>`:""}
          <div class="field">
            <label>Prioridade</label>
            <select id="tPriority">
              ${Object.keys(PRIO).map(k=>`<option value="${k}" ${k===t.priority?"selected":""}>${PRIO[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Status</label>
            <select id="tStatus">
              ${Object.keys(STATUS).map(k=>`<option value="${k}" ${k===t.status?"selected":""}>${STATUS[k].label}</option>`).join("")}
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field ${showAssignee?"":"full"}">
            <label>Prazo</label>
            <input id="tDue" type="date" value="${t.dueDate||""}">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="foot">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-close>Cancelar</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveBtn">Salvar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    `);
    document.getElementById("saveBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>{
      const title = document.getElementById("tTitle").value.trim();
      if(!title){ toast("Dê um título.", "error"); return; }
      t.title = title;
      t.description = document.getElementById("tDesc").value.trim();
      if(showAssignee) t.assigneeId = document.getElementById("tAssignee").value;
      t.priority = document.getElementById("tPriority").value;
      t.status = document.getElementById("tStatus").value;
      t.dueDate = document.getElementById("tDue").value;
      persist();
      toast("Tarefa salva.", "ok");
      closeModal();
      renderCurrentView();
    });
  }

  /* ==================== View: Equipe (gerente) ==================== */
  function renderTeam(user){
    const members = db.users.filter(u=>u.role==="membro");
    viewRoot.innerHTML = `
      <div class="page-head">
        <div>
          <h2>Equipe</h2>
          <div class="sub">Adicione e gerencie os membros. Cada um entra com seu e-mail e senha.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="addMemberBtn">+ Adicionar membro</button>
      </div>
      ${members.length?members.map(m=>{
        const count = db.tasks.filter(t=>t.assigneeId===m.id).length;
        return `<div class="member-row">
          ${userAvatar(m.name)}
          <div class="info">
            <div class="name">${esc(m.name)} <span class="role-badge member">Membro</span></div>
            <div class="email">${esc(m.email)}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="count">${count} tarefa(s)</div>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-mview="${m.id}">Ver tarefas</button>
          <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" data-mdel="${m.id}">Remover</button>
        </div>`;
      }).join("") : `<div class="empty">Nenhum membro ainda. Adicione a equipe para começar.</div>`}
    `;
    document.getElementById("addMemberBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>openMemberForm());
    viewRoot.querySelectorAll("[data-mdel]").forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener("click", ()=>{
        const m = db.users.find(u=>u.id===b.dataset.mdel);
        if(!m) return;
        if(confirm(`Remover ${m.name}? As tarefas dele serão mantidas, mas sem responsável.`)){
          db.users = db.users.filter(u=>u.id!==m.id);
          persist();
          toast("Membro removido.", "ok");
          renderTeam(currentUser());
        }
      });
    });
    viewRoot.querySelectorAll("[data-mview]").forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener("click", ()=>{
        const m = db.users.find(u=>u.id===b.dataset.mview);
        if(!m) return;
        const tasks = db.tasks.filter(t=>t.assigneeId===m.id).sort((a,b)=>b.createdAt-a.createdAt);
        openModal(`
          <div class="modal">
            <h2>Tarefas de ${esc(m.name)}</h2>
            ${tasks.length?`<div class="grid">${tasks.map(t=>taskCardHTML(t,user,false)).join("")}</div>`
              :`<div class="empty">Sem tarefas.</div>`}
            <div class="foot">
              <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-close>Fechar</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        `);
        bindTaskCardActions(modal);
      });
    });
  }

  function openMemberForm(){
    openModal(`
      <div class="modal">
        <h2>Adicionar membro</h2>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Nome *</label>
          <input id="mName" type="text" placeholder="Nome do membro">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>E-mail *</label>
          <input id="mEmail" type="email" placeholder="membro@empresa.com">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Senha inicial *</label>
          <input id="mPass" type="text" placeholder="Defina uma senha para o membro">
        </div>
        <div class="foot">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-close>Cancelar</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveMemberBtn">Adicionar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    `);
    document.getElementById("saveMemberBtn").addEventListener("click", ()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById("mName").value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById("mEmail").value.trim().toLowerCase();
      const pass = document.getElementById("mPass").value;
      if(!name || !email || !pass) return;
      if(pass.length<4){ toast("Senha muito curta.", "error"); return; }
      if(db.users.some(u=>u.email===email)){ toast("Já existe conta com esse e-mail.", "error"); return; }
      db.users.push({ id:uid(), name, email, passHash:hashPass(pass), role:"membro", createdAt:Date.now() });
      persist();
      toast("Membro adicionado: " + name, "ok");
      closeModal();
      renderTeam(currentUser());
    });
  }

  /* ==================== Sincronização entre abas ==================== */
  window.addEventListener("storage", e=>{
    if(e.key===DB_KEY){
      db = loadDB();
      const u = currentUser();
      if(u) renderCurrentView();
    }
  });
  window.addEventListener("db-sync", ()=>{
    db = loadDB();
    const u = currentUser();
    if(u) renderCurrentView();
  });

  /* ==================== Boot ==================== */
  const u = currentUser();
  if(u){
    enterApp();
  }else{
    updateFirstHint();
  }

})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
